                                li Worked as part of a three-student team to build a real-time system that recognizes emotions by analyzing facial expressions and speech together.
                                li Implemented CNN-based models for facial and speech emotion recognition using FER-2013, RAVDESS, and TESS datasets, reaching up to 93% accuracy.
                                li Added an adaptive fusion approach that adjusts the contribution of audio and visual inputs when one signal is noisy or unreliable.
